Z||000003||cadaver||07-20-2001||08:40 PM||||I replaced mine with power door lock switches. I didnt like the way the stock switches stuck up. Now with the lock switches the panel is flat.||||reg||1
Z||000004||maryjane||07-20-2001||10:21 PM||||See the section in Ogre's Cave about replacing pwr wind switches. I asked the same question a couple days ago. Reply from The Ogre was that there were no "drop in"<BR>replacements to his knowledge. Also, that Fiero's don't use a relay for window mtrs. The switches will have to carry full motor current.||||reg||1
